## Why This Is Asked
This question probes practical reliability design for LLM gateways, focusing on per-tenant isolation, simple fault handling, and testability—core beginner-to-intermediate LLm-ops concerns.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant circuit breakers and state management
- Retry with exponential backoff and jitter
- Graceful failover to cached/cheaper models
- Lightweight data models and testability

## Code Example
```javascript
// Lightweight per-tenant circuit breaker skeleton
class CircuitBreaker {
  constructor(threshold=5, windowMs=60000) {
    this.threshold = threshold; this.windowMs = windowMs;
    this.failures = {}; // tenantId -> [timestamps]
  }
  recordFailure(tid){
    const now = Date.now();
    this.failures[tid] = (this.failures[tid]||[]).concat(now);
  }
  isOpen(tid){
    const now = Date.now();
    const arr = (this.failures[tid]||[]).filter(t=>now-t<=this.windowMs);
    return arr.length >= this.threshold;
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions
- How would you monitor per-tenant circuit states at scale?
- How would you reset a circuit breaker after a long outage without data loss?

## Why This Is Asked

A practical exercise to gauge understanding of rate limiting, multi-tenant isolation, and backpressure in an LLM gateway.

## Key Concepts

- Token-bucket rate limiting
- Per-tenant quotas
- Backpressure and fairness
- Observability and tracing

## Code Example

```javascript
// Pseudo: simple token bucket for a tenant
class Bucket {
  constructor(capacity, refillPerMs) {
    this.capacity = capacity;
    this.tokens = capacity;
    this.refillPerMs = refillPerMs;
    this.last = Date.now();
  }
  take(n = 1) {
    const now = Date.now();
    const elapsed = now - this.last;
    this.tokens = Math.min(this.capacity, this.tokens + elapsed * this.refillPerMs);
    this.last = now;
    if (this.tokens >= n) {
      this.tokens -= n;
      return true;
    }
    return false;
  }
}
```

## Follow-up Questions

- How would bucket state persist across restarts?
- How would you scale this across many gateway instances?
